      "created_at": "2019-01-13T23:55:58Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-01-13T23:55:58Z",
      "body": "The problem is that most production node deployment use HTTP not HTTPS (using an external front HTTPS LB). This means that you cannot decide if cookies should be secure based on the protocol level at the hapi server level.\r\n\r\nIf the docs can be clearer on that, please submit a PR. Otherwise, there isn't much I can do about this.",
